export default function Page(){return <SiteShell active="credits/"><main id={"main"}><section className={"page-head wrap"}><p className={"eyebrow"}>{"Project notes"}</p><h1>{"THE DETAILS"}<br />{"BEHIND THE EXPERIENCE."}</h1><p className={"intro"}>{"Transparent sources, honest demonstration data and local-only interactions."}</p></section><section className={"article-body"}><h2>{"Independent by design"}</h2><p>{"Independent concept project. Not affiliated with or endorsed by AC Milan. ClubSphere uses official club-sourced player portraits, archive images and team crests in an independent concept presentation. Club names are used for historical and editorial identification."}</p><h2>{"What is fictional?"}</h2><p>{"Player names, numbers, nationalities and portraits come from the official 2026/27 directory. Fixtures, match events and results remain fictional. Academy pathways and partnership concepts are illustrative. Articles are original concept editorials, not club news. The roster is a dated snapshot; no live data is claimed."}</p><h2>{"Historical sources"}</h2><p className={"source"}><a href={"https://www.acmilan.com/en/club/history"} target={"_blank"} rel={"noopener noreferrer"}>{"Club history ↗"}</a></p><p className={"source"}><a href={"https://www.acmilan.com/en/club/palmares/uefa-champions-league"} target={"_blank"} rel={"noopener noreferrer"}>{"European honours ↗"}</a></p><p className={"source"}><a href={"https://www.acmilan.com/en/news/articles/club/2024-07-16/125-years-of-ac-milan-the-program-of-initiatives"} target={"_blank"} rel={"noopener noreferrer"}>{"Honours snapshot, July 2024 ↗"}</a></p><p className={"source"}><a href={"https://www.acmilan.com/en/club/venues/san-siro"} target={"_blank"} rel={"noopener noreferrer"}>{"San Siro history ↗"}</a></p><p>{"Legend biographies are concise paraphrases of the official AC Milan archive and UEFA profiles. The complete source list is included in the project README."}</p><h2>{"Photography & assets"}</h2><p>{"Bundled football photographs are atmospheric references from Unsplash, not representations of named fictional players. Full asset credits accompany the source code. Official player portraits, alternate hover poses, legends images and crests are included with exact source URLs in the asset manifests. These assets remain copyrighted; their inclusion does not grant a redistribution license."}</p><h2>{"Your privacy"}</h2><p>{"The favourite-player feature saves a player identifier in localStorage on this device. Use “Clear saved choice” to remove it. Quiz answers are held in memory. Contact briefs download locally. There are no accounts, analytics, tracking cookies or form transmissions."}</p><h2>{"Accessibility"}</h2><p>{"Keyboard navigation, visible focus, reduced motion, semantic landmarks and descriptive labels are built into the experience. This is not a claim of audited WCAG certification."}</p></section></main></SiteShell>;}
